ASK { gmeow:carrierType a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:carrierType MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — a carrier may be classified plurally by different standpoints (Principle 9). Mirrors test_carrier_type_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

