ASK { gmeow:readingOf a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:readingOf MUST be owl:FunctionalProperty — one source inscription per InscriptionReading relator (functional per relator doctrine). Mirrors test_reading_of_is_functional." .

