ASK { gmeow:readingResult a owl:ObjectProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:readingResult MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty — the lexical form(s) produced by a reading. Mirrors test_reading_result_is_non_functional (positive part)." .

# --- 14. readingResult is NOT functional (MUST-NOT) ----------------------------
ex:saReadingResultNotFunctional a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK { gmeow:readingResult a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:readingResult MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — a single reading may yield multiple coexisting forms (e.g. ambiguous signs), and competing result claims from different readings coexist (Principle 9). Mirrors test_reading_result_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

