ASK { gmeow:transliterationResult a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:transliterationResult MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — competing transliteration schemes may produce different forms for the same inscription and those claims coexist (Principle 9). Mirrors test_transliteration_result_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

