ASK { gmeow:translationResult a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:translationResult MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — competing translations of the same inscription coexist without privilege (Principle 9). Mirrors test_translation_result_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

