    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:attributedLanguage MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — competing language assignments from different standpoints coexist, and a bilingual inscription may carry multiple languages (Principle 9). Mirrors test_attributed_language_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

