ASK { gmeow:findContextEvent a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:findContextEvent MUST NOT be owl:FunctionalProperty — a carrier may be rediscovered or re-documented multiple times. Mirrors test_find_context_event_is_non_functional (negative part)." .

